n></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be completed in less than 30 minutes  if running without exploring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring can add approximately 15-30 minutes of additional gameplay, depending on whether the player walks or runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several checkpoints, but no save system due to the short length of the game. The game is linear. If you get stuck at an encounter, check the environment for clues and remember to use your flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are two endings that are achieved by a single choice in the game, and the game must be played twice in order to achieve both endings.</strong></p>","developers":["BoxLoafEnd"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294500/7fec2b3ce06f8394c7ca50ad6ee14fc268b6f1c6/header.jpg?t=1757355531","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257184296,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184296/movie480.mp4?t=1755707576","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184296/movie_max.mp4?t=1755707576"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184296/5a3d6a2b1cf6f3380cd2e909c176bc17b1933cbf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755707576","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184296/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755707576","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184296/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755707576"}}],"name":"Dead Apples Dare","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i7<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080<br></li>